      "content": "it's just so exhausting. every single day is just me trying to pretend there's someone inside this body, but there isn't. it's like being trapped in a house that's been abandoned but the lights are still on for no reason. if the person who made it all worth it is really gone... why does the rest of this have to keep going? why is it considered \"right\" to just endure this emptiness?",
